variant_punning_errors.pas:19:7: error: a set in a variant part without a tag field (`S`) is not supported yet
      case Integer of
      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^

variant_punning_errors.pas:25:15: error: `Node` has a variant part without a tag field that holds a pointer (or a file), so Ruscal keeps each variant separately and can't tell which one to store as bytes; how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#variant-with-pointer
   f: file of Node;
              ^^^^

variant_punning_errors.pas:37:15: error: `p` is passed by `var` more than once in this call to `Swap`; Rust doesn't allow two mutable references to the same variable (fields of a variant part without a tag field share its bytes, which Rust borrows as a whole; copy one into a local first); how to rewrite it: https://github.com/jjinux/ruscal/blob/main/docs/rust_limits.md#two-var-arguments
   Swap(p.Lo, p.Hi);
              ^^^^
